{"path":"YouTube.html","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Creator Capital — The Complete Guide to Making Money on YouTube</title>
<meta name="description" content="A professional, no-fluff guide to building a YouTube channel and turning it into a profitable business: revenue streams, roadmap, monetization requirements and a live earnings calculator.">
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%2032%2032'%3E%3Crect%20width='32'%20height='32'%20rx='7'%20fill='%23ff4757'/%3E%3Cpath%20d='M12%209l12%207-12%207z'%20fill='white'/%3E%3C/svg%3E">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
