  <!-- ================= REVENUE STREAMS ================= -->
  <section class="section alt" id="streams">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head center reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>01 · Revenue Streams</span>
        <h2>Eight ways your channel can make money</h2>
        <p class="lead">Ad revenue is just the foundation. The channels that build real income stack
        <strong>multiple streams</strong> — here's the full playbook.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stream-grid">
        <article class="stream-card reveal">
          <div class="stream-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v10M9.5 9.8c0-1.1 1.1-2 2.5-2s2.5.9 2.5 2c0 2.8-5 1.7-5 4.4 0 1.1 1.1 2 2.5 2s2.5-.9 2.5-2"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Ad Revenue (YPP)</h3>
          <p>Pre-roll, mid-roll and display ads on your videos. Once monetized, every view has a price tag — and the right niche multiplies it.</p>
          <span class="stream-tag">RPM $0.50 – $40+</span>
        </article>
        <article class="stream-card reveal d1">
          <div class="stream-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="7" width="18" height="13" rx="2"/><path d="M8 7V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2M3 12h18"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Brand Deals &amp; Sponsorships</h3>
          <p>Integrations, dedicated reviews and host-reads. The single largest income source for most mid-size channels — often worth more than AdSense.</p>
          <span class="stream-tag">$500 – $25K+ per deal</span>
        </article>
        <article class="stream-card reveal d2">
          <div class="stream-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.5.5l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7-7l-1.7 1.7"/><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.5-.5l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7 7l1.7-1.7"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Affiliate Marketing</h3>
          <p>Recommend tools, gear and services with tracked links. Passive commission on every sale — and it works even before you hit monetization.</p>
          <span class="stream-tag">5% – 40% commission</span>
        </article>
        <article class="stream-card reveal">
          <div class="stream-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Channel Memberships</h3>
          <p>Monthly recurring revenue from superfans: badges, emotes, member-only videos and community posts. Predictable and compounding.</p>
          <span class="stream-tag">$4.99 – $49.99 / month</span>
